# signed.tflw — CHECK-ONLY FIXTURE (`C127`, tflw `M246`): one request signed with `stripe`. Checked,
# never run: under `signer.config` it is clean, and under a config that declares no signer its
# `sign with` is `TF086`, which is the proof that the check read the declaration.

test "a signed request"
  api POST /webhooks/stripe body { id: "evt_1" }
    sign with stripe
  expect status equals 200
